    "text": "Share:\nSussex County Libraries Children's Book Festival\nSussex County Libraries Children's Book Festival,10 a.m. to 2 p.m., Milton library, 121 Union St., Milton. Meet regional children’s book authors, crafts, activities at Milton Memorial Park, food trucks, free admission, attendees will receive Festival Guide and tote bag upon entry (while supplies last). For information go to facebook.com/sussexcbf.\nEvent Date:\nSat, 05/02/2026 - 10:00am to 2:00pm",
